     "type": "box",
     "kind": "remember",
     "title": "Remember",
     "items": [
      "The ligature goes after the first word, in either order.",
      "With several adjectives, only the last takes a ligature.",
      "Repeat for emphasis: malínaw na malínaw.",
      "No ligature after kung; noun + ko/mo/niyá…; adjective + ka/kayó."
     ]
    }
